    "detailed_description": "Jungle Gems VR is an exhilarating virtual reality game that invites players to embark on an exciting adventure through lush jungles filled with captivating puzzles and precious gemstones. Immerse yourself in a world teeming with vibrant foliage, ancient ruins, and hidden treasures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/db2c047b003cb0ac78f9116411a53e1d.poster.avif?t=1684168443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/db2c047b003cb0ac78f9116411a53e1d.webm?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/db2c047b003cb0ac78f9116411a53e1d.mp4?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/f3b467e323de4fb183abbe744880ee57.poster.avif?t=1684168443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/f3b467e323de4fb183abbe744880ee57.webm?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/f3b467e323de4fb183abbe744880ee57.mp4?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this immersive VR experience, your primary objective is to solve intricate puzzles by strategically matching and collecting colorful gems. Using your hands and body movements, you can reach out and interact with the gems, manipulating them within the virtual environment. The intuitive controls allow you to feel a genuine connection to the game world, as if you are physically exploring the jungle yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/378c93675edc09fa4e979f76ce438371.poster.avif?t=1684168443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/378c93675edc09fa4e979f76ce438371.webm?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/378c93675edc09fa4e979f76ce438371.mp4?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/c7f80b82efb1ca4b2545195d0990cc88.poster.avif?t=1684168443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/c7f80b82efb1ca4b2545195d0990cc88.webm?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/c7f80b82efb1ca4b2545195d0990cc88.mp4?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Jungle Gems VR offers an enticing blend of exploration and puzzle-solving. Each level presents unique challenges, requiring you to employ your critical thinking skills and observation abilities to uncover the solutions. Traverse through dense vegetation, navigate treacherous paths, and unlock hidden chambers to unveil the mysteries of the jungle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/952ae66569f98a9e269716fd85e52bc0.poster.avif?t=1684168443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/952ae66569f98a9e269716fd85e52bc0.webm?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/952ae66569f98a9e269716fd85e52bc0.mp4?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you progress through the game, the puzzles become increasingly complex, demanding more dexterity and problem-solving prowess. The difficulty curve ensures a rewarding and satisfying experience, as you conquer each challenge and uncover rare and valuable gems along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/f9d5eec87ef98f1250f2b5d89521d672.poster.avif?t=1684168443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/f9d5eec87ef98f1250f2b5d89521d672.webm?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433370/extras/f9d5eec87ef98f1250f2b5d89521d672.mp4?t=1684168443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With its stunning visuals, immersive gameplay, and a wide variety of puzzles, Jungle Gems VR provides a captivating adventure for virtual reality enthusiasts. Prepare to be captivated by the beauty of the jungle and test your puzzle-solving skills in this enchanting VR experience.",
